":\"table\",\"heading\":\"Podrobnosti\",\"body\":\"Svršek:  | Textil\\nMezipodešev:  | Altra EGO™ MAX\\nPodešev: | Vibram® Megagrip\\nPodšívka:  | textil\\nDrop (mm):  | \\t0\\n\\nNepromokavost:  | Ano\\nMembrána:  | \\tGORE-TEX®\\nŠířka obuvi:  | Normální\\nHmotnost\\/pár  |  664 g\"}],\"gallery\":[\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/271870--51e0fdd17ad1f0567d4329dd.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/271871--c76b11d985eed832cd973d6b.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/271872--3bcd347e9b135cf3bbab0390.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/271873--1a430c92ac24b81d99b46b0a.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/271868--aa1a779877ae457c0a519197.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/284742--e35429daad39cb16e2ca6b5e.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/284743--89997b0e1e203b59e238ac07.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/284744--22ea7aeb07de37fb04d13474.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/284745--2e8809fad6098e6a1549b4fd.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/284746--4b34ee2d309cceaf7c8413aa.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b\\/284747--77b33da52845c995448eec23.jpg\"]}', 'batohy', '', 5000, 'images/media/products/a81b39caaea84851affe610cd37f5b1b/271869--ccb152fa648e842efd6c357e.jpg', '', 'in_stock', 1, '2026-10-03 04:24:49'),
