-A na USB-C\"},{\"type\":\"list\",\"heading\":\"Parametry\",\"body\":\"Kapacita: 20 000 mAh, 3.6 V (72 Wh)\\nJmenovitá kapacita: 11 220 mAh, 5 V (TYP 3A)\\nVstup: USB-C (IN1): 5V=3 A \\/ 9V=2A \\/ 12V=1.5A (18W MAX)\\nVstup: USB-C (IN2): 5V=3 A \\/ 9V=2A \\/ 12V=1.5A (18W MAX)\\nVýstup: USB-C (OUT1): 5V=3A \\/ 9V=2.22A \\/ 12V=1.66A (22.5W MAX)\\nVýstup: USB-C (OUT2): 5V=2.4A \\/ 9V=2A \\/ 12V=1.5A (18W MAX)\\nDuální porty 5V=3A (MAX)\\nRozměry: 118 mm × 69 mm × 21,5 mm\"}],\"gallery\":[\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/8d1a28022df0b255a57a3005e2ad67d5e1dfd285--c2f292b35ea12f8e0992a9de.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/7589-2-nb2-3-566x566--a54e7fcf88e7c6b3c1881da1.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/7589-11-nb2-16--d8af7c4dd6a07a92c344db98.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/7589-16-nb2-21--d2a3fa8bd4889e5affaf680d.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/7589-19-nitecore-vykonna-powerbanka-nb2000--db5a6e0a764c4b33f38f8dd7.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/a1c92e1e55eac168fe06f33721b26d44f976f9c9--2c03807c4d5096a774d3d927.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/dbdd1083fc502e2e67b2d183f09f41c5b9c64fe6--62631c422529e77ab0637f31.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/f58605d14750e720da5718a2ff44ac4b9283b7b1--aa194fb5328a418be41b3b5e.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/nitecore-nb20000-power-bank-gen3-01-566x56--6894d3d748a21bc80f1c190c.jpg\",\"images\\/media\\/products\\/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59\\/nitecore-nb20000-power-bank-gen3-01--872e50dccac596efbf88b356.jpg\"]}', 'batohy', '', 1, 'images/media/products/23a7e4e77f54f49e4d365842f8e94f59/nitecore-nb20000-power-bank-gen3-01-566x56--37717b45b40bc534ba9a0ae9.jpg', '', 'out_of_stock', 0, '2026-10-04 23:25:06'),
